NAME
    shutdown, quit, exit - terminate the shell process

SYNOPSIS
    shutdown
    quit
    exit

DESCRIPTION
    Requests termination of the shell or host process. 'quit' and 'exit'
    are built-in aliases for shutdown.

EXAMPLES
    shutdown
    quit
    exit

EXIT STATUS
    0   Always succeeds and requests process exit.

SEE ALSO
    dianash(1), tmux(1)
